Virtualization is a concept which introduced the process of running multiple programs on a single physical server
a layer called hypervisor was introduced to act as a Software that creates and manages VMs and allocates physical resources to them
hypervisor are implemented by 2 types
1. hypervisor run directly on physical hardware 
2. hypervisor run within an existing operating system
Container: isolates an application and its dependencies while sharing the host OS kernel.
